" Stelsel: x' = y, y' = -x geeft x = cos t
Given
x'(t) == y(t)
y'(t) == -x(t)
x(0) == 1
y(0) == 0
[x; y] := odesolve([x; y], t, 4)
x(π) =        // verwacht: -1
y(π/2) =      // verwacht: -1
" Randwaardeprobleem: v'' + v = 0, v(0) = 0, v(π/2) = 1 geeft v = sin s
Given
v''(s) + v(s) == 0
v(0) == 0
v(π/2) == 1
v := odesolve(s, 3)
v(π/6) =      // verwacht: 0.5
" Ligger: doorbuiging in het midden is 5 q L^4 / (384 EI)
q := 10 kN/m
EI := 20000 kN*m^2
L := 6 m
Given
w''''(z) == q / EI
w(0 m) == 0 m
w''(0 m) == 0
w(L) == 0 m
w''(L) == 0
w := odesolve(z, L)
w(L/2) = mm   // verwacht: 8.4375 mm
" Stijf: Radau voor y' = -y geeft e^-2 in x = 2
D(u, v) := [-v[0]]
R := Radau([1], 0, 2, 4, D)
R[4, 1] =     // verwacht: 0.135335
